  "body_markdown": "Skip to content\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4 Dental Implants\n\nFixed Teeth vs. Removable\n\nCost & Compare\n\nDental Implant FAQ\n\nAesthetics\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers\n\nDental Crowns & Bridges\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nTreatments\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nOral Surgery\n\nEmergency Dentistry\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nSmile Gallery\n\nWho We Are\n\nWhy Choose Us\n\nMeet Dr. Esam Nahlah\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nPatient Stories\n\nFor Doctors\n\nReferral Form\n\nContact Us\n\nBlog\n\nCurrent Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria: (703) 940-5410\n\nNew Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (571) 619-9442\n\nAlexandria: (571) 410-3430\n\nBook now\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n# Prosthodontist in McLean, VA\n\n\n\n## Your Perfect Smile Starts Here.\n\n\nFor over 20 years, award-winning prosthodontist Dr. Esam Nahlah has provided dental patients in the Washington, D.C. area with a unique blend of…\n\n\n### Experience, Skill, and Dental Artistry.\n\n\n\n## Get a Sneak Peek\n\n\n\n## Schedule Your Free Consultation\n\n\nPlease, fill out the form below, and our treatment coordinator will reach out to you shortly.\n\n\n##### Contact Us\n\n\nName(Required)\n\nFirst\n\nLast\n\nEmail(Required)\n\nPhone(Required)\n\nUntitled(Required)\n\nPlease, click here and select reason for consultationDental ImplantsVeneersCrownBridgeSmile Makeover\n\nWhat to Expect\n\nMeet The Doctor\n\nFinancing & Insurance\n\nOur Reviews\n\n\n## The Patient Experience\n\n\nDental patients should expect state-of-the-art care and unparalleled clinical expertise. At Dental Group of Tysons, however, we believe in offering patients much more than just world-class results. We are proud to offer elite-level dental care in a warm, welcoming and friendly environment, and we will do whatever it takes to ensure that your experience with us is a positive and successful one\n\nGet To Know Us\n\n\n## Meet our Doctor\n\n\nAs an award-winning board-certified specialist in prosthodontic dentistry, Dr. Nahlah provides patients with a premier level of dental care using the industry’s most advanced technology. Dr. Nahlah’s expertise encompasses full-mouth dental restorations, computer-guided surgeries, digital smile design, porcelain veneers … and much more! In 2013, the American Board of Prosthodontics awarded Dr. Nahlah the most prestigious award in prosthodontics: “Diplomate of American Board of Prosthodontics.”\n\n\n#### Dr. Esam Nahlah\n\n\nRead More\n\n\n## Affordable Payment Optionsr\n\n\nDr. Nahlah believes that cost should never be a deterrent to receiving quality dental care. Our team offers a variety of insurance and financing options in an effort to make our care affordable and accessible, no matter what your budget is. We currently accept most major dental insurance providers, and also offer third-party financing options through a variety of lending partners.\n\nKnow Your Options\n\n\n## Affordable Payment Optionsr\n\n\n\n##### Patient Name\n\n\n★★★★★\n\n“It’s a great place! Dr. Nahlah’s done such a good job. And look at me; my teeth are like that of a Hollywood star!”\n\nView More Stories\n\n\n### Dedicated to our Patients.\n\n\n\n### Inspired by our Community.\n\n\nAt Dental Group of Tysons in McLean, VA, Dr. Nahlah and his team of elite dental professionals believes in offering more than technologically advanced dental care and services. We know that each patient’s experience is unique, and this is why we make it a point to develop and maintain meaningful, personalized relationships with every patient we see. As soon as you walk through our office doors, you will be greeted with a warm, friendly ambiance and a welcoming atmosphere founded on care, compassion and a genuine consideration for each patient’s unique needs. For over 20 years, Dr. Nahlah has been providing quality dental care to residents of the Washington, D.C. area. Join our family today and experience what patient-focused, community-driven dentistry is all about!\n\nCall our office today\n\n\n## Elite Dental Care\n\n\n\n#### All-on-4® Implants\n\n\nAll-on-4 dental implants offer the most advanced solution to full mouth rehabilitation and dental reconstruction. For patients who are missing some or all of their teeth, or for patients looking to transition from removable dentures, full mouth dental implants provide a permanent, fixed solution that fully restores a patient’s natural, perfect smile.\n\n\n#### Sedation Dentistry\n\n\nIf you’re one of the millions of patients who suffer from dental anxiety, Dental Group of Tysons offers a complete range of sedation options to help make your treatment(s) as comfortable, convenient and pain-free as possible. Dr. Nahlah offers IV and oral sedation options, as well as nitrous oxide under the guidance of a medical anesthesiologist, to make your dental experience as smooth and hassle-free as possible.\n\n\n#### Smile Makeover\n\n\nBoasting over 20 years of experience in cosmetic dentistry applications, Dr. Nahlah employs a unique set of skills and dental artistry techniques in order to recreate each patient’s unique natural smile. If you’re looking for brilliant, stunning teeth and a truly perfect smile, get in touch with Dr. Nahlah today to schedule your own personalized Smile Makeover.\n\n\n## DC's Implant Dentistry & Prosthodontics Specialist\n\n\nView More Videos\n\n\n## Our Patients tell the story best\n\n\nPlay\n\n\n### Find out if you're a\n\n\n\n## candidate for dental implants\n\n\n\n#### Answer the Following Questions To Learn more about our pricing and financing options.\n\n\n\n## Perfect, Brilliantly Crafted Smiles - It's What We Do.\n\n\nCall Now To Book An Appointment\n\nBook Now\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddresses:\n\nTysons Corner\n\n7901 Jones Branch Dr., Suite 220\n\nMcLean, VA 22102\n\nNew Patients: (571) 619-9442\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria\n\n2855 Duke St,\n\nAlexandria, VA 22314\n\nNew Patients: (571) 410-3430\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 940-5410\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 8:00am – 2:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\nAll-On-4® Implants\n\nCrowns & Bridges\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nMeet the Doctor\n\nAbout Us\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\n2025 Dr. Nahlah. All rights reserved",
